  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• When the oil is hot, fry gnocchi, tossing occasionally, until golden, 6-8 minutes. Transfer to a bowl. <br>• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Finely chop garlic.</p> <p>TIP: Add extra oil if the gnocchi sticks to the pan.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a505fc1830ec44f0eb/step-80dd0600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. <br>• Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Add garlic, savoury seasoning and tomato, tossing, until fragrant and softened, 1-2 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a505fc1830ec44f0eb/step-89973310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Reduce heat to medium. Add chicken-style stock powder, Italian herbs, light cooking cream and the water, stirring until bubbling, 1 minute. <br>• Add cooked gnocchi and baby spinach leaves, stirring until wilted, 1 minute. Season with pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a505fc1830ec44f0eb/step-47f12220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide one-pan creamy plant-based mince gnocchi with tomato and baby spinach between bowls. <br>• Sprinkle over flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185a505fc1830ec44f0eb/step-0342e730.jpg"
    }
  ]
